---
title: Scheduling and Execution Workflow
---
flowchart TB
    Start([Start]) --> Submit[Client submits job via CLI]
    Submit --> Queue[Job enters scheduler queue]
    Queue --> Poll{Worker polls for job?}

    Poll -->|Yes| Select[Scheduler selects job using algorithm]
    Poll -->|No| Poll

    Select --> Assign[Scheduler assigns job to worker]
    Assign --> Confirm[Worker confirms receipt]
    Confirm --> Setup[Worker creates cgroup]

    Setup --> Fork[Worker forks djs-executor]
    Fork --> Attach[Attach eBPF monitor to cgroup]
    Attach --> Monitor[Monitor execution + collect metrics]

    Monitor --> Complete{Job completes?}

    Complete -->|Success| Collect[Parse result JSON]
    Complete -->|Error| Fail[Report failure]

    Collect --> Cleanup[Tear down cgroup]
    Fail --> Cleanup

    Cleanup --> Report[Worker reports result to scheduler]
    Report --> Analytics[Scheduler computes runtime analytics]
    Analytics --> DB[Store analytics for future scheduling]

    DB --> EndJob([End])
